            "text": "<color=#ffd780>普通攻擊</color>\n造成2點 <color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color> 。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "盤繞風引",
        "title": "盤繞風引",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/c810824214ed1ed7d4c4519a109c0ba5_6530786908738716528.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>元素戰技</color>\n造成3點 <color=#80ffd7>風元素傷害</color> ，抽1張牌。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "噬骸能量塊",
        "title": "噬骸能量塊",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/db13288db6b90ec33f8adc2656d2019f_7652734859094548440.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd680>事件牌</color> <color=#ffffff>（花費：0）</color>\n隨機 <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 1張 <color=#ffffff>目前元素骰費用</color> 最高的手牌，生成1個我方出戰角色類型的元素骰。（每回合最多打出1張）"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": [],
        "talentImg": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/531ed6322b0a8f721e6080da7fcd72ce_2387933179456157272.png"
      },
      {
        "key": "錯落風渦",
        "title": "錯落風渦",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/1d8d506cdab76fd7660ea285c094d231_2372761412499203591.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>元素爆發</color>\n造成2點 <color=#80ffd7>風元素傷害</color> ， <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 手牌中所有的 <color=#ffffff>噬骸能量塊</color> ，每 <color=#ffffff>捨棄</color> 2張，此次傷害翻倍1次。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "不朽亡骸 · 風",
        "title": "不朽亡骸 · 風",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/1f7f5486da184cb626eb0891eeb2a204_6377372209010469591.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffd780>被動技能</color>\n【被動】戰鬥開始時，生成6張 <color=#ffffff>噬骸能量塊</color> ，均勻放入牌庫。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "風元素傷害",
        "title": "風元素傷害",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/c97292d96456bfe4abeca16bfce801e4_4144438257155004052.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "和已附著的元素發生元素反應：\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#99ffff>冰元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（冰）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點冰元素傷害\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#80c0ff>水元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（水）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點水元素傷害\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#ff9999>火元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（火）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點火元素傷害\n【 <color=#80ffd7>風元素</color> + <color=#ffacff>雷元素</color> 】 <color=#ffffff>擴散（雷）</color> ：對目標以外的所有敵方角色造成1點雷元素傷害"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      },
      {
        "key": "規則解釋",
        "title": "規則解釋",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2024/08/25/125391187/07bae546ac7c69ef6402170b283840c5_6150128629256623683.png",
        "desc": [
          {
            "type": "RichText",
            "text": "<color=#ffffff>物理傷害</color>\n物理傷害不會附著元素，也不會發生元素反應。\n<color=#ffffff>目前元素骰費用</color>\n行動牌被賦予 <color=#ffffff>費用增加</color> 和 <color=#ffffff>費用降低</color> 時，目前元素骰費用會對應變化。\n（打出時少花費元素骰的效果不會影響此費用）\n<color=#ffffff>費用增加</color>\n每層使打出此卡牌多花費1個元素骰。（可疊加，沒有上限）\n<color=#ffffff>費用降低</color>\n每層使打出此卡牌少花費1個元素骰。（可疊加，沒有上限）\n<color=#ffffff>捨棄</color>\n透過行動牌或角色技能的效果，將行動牌從手牌或牌庫中棄置。"
          }
        ],
        "attributes": []
      }
    ]
  }
